{"ref":"BDB, מֵ֫צַח","hw":"מֵ֫צַח","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מֵ֫צַח</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.8\">Ez 3:8</a> <strong>brow, forehead</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.7\">Ez 3:7</a>, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:38\" href=\"/Exodus.28.38\">Ex 28:38</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.3\">Je 3:3</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְחֲךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.8\">Ez 3:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.4\">Is 48:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְחֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.9\">Ez 3:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְחוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:38\" href=\"/Exodus.28.38\">Ex 28:38</a> + 4 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְחָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.8\">Ez 3:8</a>; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְחוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.4\">Ez 9:4</a>;—<em>brow, forehead</em>, struck by stone from David’s sling <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:49\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.49\">1 S 17:49</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; Aaron’s forehead <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:38\" href=\"/Exodus.28.38\">Ex 28:38</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; place where leprosy appears <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.19\">2 Ch 26:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.20\">20</a>; place for a distinguishing mark or cross <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.4\">Ez 9:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חִזְקֵי־מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.7\">3:7</a> the house of Isr. are <em>stout of forehead</em> (i. e. obstinate; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קְשֵׁי־לֵב</span>), cf. v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.8\">8</a>; so <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְחֲךָ נְחוּשָׁה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.4\">Is 48:4</a> <em>thy brow</em> (is) <em>brass</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּיד בַּרְזֶל עָרְפֶּ֑ךָ</span>); also of boldness, firmness of prophet v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.8\">8</a>, and v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.9\">9</a> (but del. 𝔊 Co); <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ אִשָּׁה זוֹנָה הָיָה לָךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.3\">Je 3:3</a>, i. e. thou wast shameless (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵאַנְתְּ הִכָּלֵם</span>).","next":"BDB, מִצְחָה","prev":"BDB, מצח"}